              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8000' id='221' type-v2='text' w='98934' x='533' y='21684'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#37352f' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Order Loss Calculation Table - Overtriggering Declines</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#37352f' fontname='Tableau Light'>In this scenario, an outage caused the FinFS to trigger more declines than it should. Order loss is measured as:  </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#37352f' fontname='Tableau Light' italic='true'>Order Loss = (Total Orders during the incident * Delta of Decline Rate)</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#37352f' fontname='Tableau Light'>Where Delta of Decline Rate is calculated as the difference between a &apos;normal decline rate&apos; and the current one. </run>
                  <run>
Please find more information about Order Loss Calculation here: </run>
                  <run auto-url='true' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=476374103&amp;quot;'>https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=476374103</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
