                <zone h='8210' id='73' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='14133' x='71200' y='13158' />
                <zone h='8210' id='72' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='14134' x='85333' y='13158' />
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8422' id='69' type-v2='text' w='98934' x='533' y='21367'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#37352f' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Order Loss Calculation Table - Overtriggering Reviews / 3DS</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#37352f' fontname='Tableau Light'>In this scenario, an outage caused the FinFS to trigger more reviews than it should. Order loss is measured as: </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Semibold' italic='true'>Order Loss = (Total Orders on Incident * Delta of Review Rate * (1-3DS Success Rate))</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#37352f' fontname='Tableau Light'>Where Delta of Review Rate is calculated as the difference between a &apos;normal review rate&apos; and the current one. </run>
                  <run>
Please find more information about Order Loss Calculation here: </run>
                  <run auto-url='true' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=476374103&amp;quot;'>https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=476374103</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
