              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8738' id='69' type-v2='text' w='98934' x='533' y='21367'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#37352f' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Order Loss Calculation Table - Underscoring Orders</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#37352f' fontname='Tableau Light'>In this scenario, there were less/no orders were scrired in the FinFS. Order loss is measured as: </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold' italic='true'>Order Loss = (Total Orders * Delta of Decline Rate) + (Total Orders * Delta of Review Rate * (1-3DS Success Rate))</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#37352f' fontname='Tableau Light'>Where Delta of Review Rate is calculated as the difference between a &apos;normal review rate&apos; and the current one, same approach is for Delta of Decline Rate.</run>
                  <run>
Please find more information about Order Loss Calculation here: </run>
                  <run auto-url='true' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=476374103&amp;quot;'>https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=476374103</run>
                </formatted-text>
